# Raw vendor bulk downloads. data/ already covers data/raw/, but these are multi-hundred-MB
# licensed archives, so this is a second, path-independent guard: a zip anywhere in the tree
# is never committable, however it got there.
*.zip
*.csv.gz
*.parquet

# O8: full VRP equity curves + trade logs are derived data (~5 MB), regenerable
options-bot/options_backtest/options_backtest_*.json
